      "html": "<section id=\"object-section-cards\" aria-label=\"原件卡片与试卷分节\" class=\"space-y-6\"><header class=\"bp-section-header\" data-slot=\"bp-section-header\"><div class=\"bp-section-main\"><div class=\"bp-section-title-row\"><h2 id=\"_R_1_\" class=\"bp-section-title text-section-title\">原件与成果分节</h2></div><p class=\"bp-section-description text-ui-hint\">原件沿用现有固定扫描夹具；下方试卷有 A / B 两个实际分节。状态和计数均来自当前示例内容。</p></div></header><section aria-labelledby=\"_R_2_\" class=\"bp-frame-card\" data-slot=\"bp-frame-card\"><header class=\"bp-frame-card-head\"><h3 id=\"_R_2_\" class=\"bp-frame-card-title text-ui-action\">作答原件 · 完整扫描纸</h3><div class=\"bp-frame-card-status text-ui-hint\" data-tone=\"info\"><span class=\"bp-frame-card-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"bp-frame-card-status-label\">第 1 / 2 份作答</span></div><div class=\"bp-card-actions\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看上一份原件\" disabled=\"\" data-icon=\"\" class=\"bp-tool\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-left size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"></path><path d=\"M19 12H5\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"查看下一份原件\" data-icon=\"\" class=\"bp-tool\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class=\"bp-card-body\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22600%22%20height%3D%22820%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%22600%22%20height%3D%22820%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M40%2090H560M40%20120